    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about the mask. it's everything. the way people look at me, the way the world is built for everyone but me... it feels like i'm playing a game where the rules are rigged against me from the start. i'm just so done with the struggle. it feels like there's no point in even trying to change things if it just stays this hard forever.",
